OL,3,GNEWSAFormer Sinn Fein MLA and IRA
OL,4,Aprisoner Paul Butler dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Sinn Fein assembly member and
OL,7,Fex-IRA prisoner Paul Butler has died.
OL,9,FAlso known as Pol de Buitleir, he
OL,10,Fstepped down from politics in 2011
OL,11,Fafter a time as Lagan Valley MLA.
OL,13,FHe had confessed to the 1974 murder of
OL,14,F50-year-old reserve RUC constable John
OL,15,FRodgers, who was shot while he was on
OL,16,Ffoot patrol on the Antrim Road,
OL,17,FGlengormley, and was jailed for 15
OL,18,Fyears.
OL,20,FA spokesperson for Sinn Fein said he
OL,21,Fwas out walking when he took unwell and
OL,22,Fpassed away at home.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
